; ..\_01_BSW\Src\Nm\Nm.c	  5921               used by Nm_BusNmSpecificPduRxIndication, created by the ComStackLib. 
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\Nm\Nm.c	  5922               The index Nm_GetSysToNmChInd(nmNetworkHandle) or nmNetworkHandle validity is proven in Nm_BusNmSpecificPduRxIndication. 
