; ..\_01_BSW\Src\Nm\Nm.c	  5929  \CM CM_NMIF_GENERAL_FUNCTIONCALL The parameters are not used in address calculations for memory manipulating
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\Nm\Nm.c	  5930                                   operations. Such calculations include but are not limited to: Array indexing,
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\Nm\Nm.c	  5931                                   pointer offset calculation and related forms of pointer arithmetic. Furthermore
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\Nm\Nm.c	  5932                                   these parameters are not forwarded to other software modules which could use
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\Nm\Nm.c	  5933                                   them for such operations unless they implement appropriate countermeasures.
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\Nm\Nm.c	  5934                                   And the addresses in the pointer variables are not saved in global variables
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\Nm\Nm.c	  5935                                   so that they could be used outside the function call. In that case, they are no
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\Nm\Nm.c	  5936                                   longer valid.
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\Nm\Nm.c	  5937  */
